<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 12 to 15 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.4.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.4.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.3.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1215corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.4.0 (2026-11-26): Objective stage only (one stage per version). Each goal is measured by objectives (22 in all), each metric derived from its goal, each with a counted, derived or judged measurement and a query that reads it, a baseline measured on 2026-11-26 (logs in 08-tooling/lineage12-opening/; the balloon, own-version and example counts from the files named in each query) and a baseline observation. The six goals that are met by absence (containment and five exclusions) carry the direction Hold: their figure is read from git or by the reviewers at every observation and can rise. Checkpoint dates are forecasts from backlog_date_plan, never deadlines. Forecast dates: see each objective's rationale. The goals of 1.3.0 are given their origin (session drafted) and their accountable decider (the Owner) here, as the stage rules now require."""@en .

